# The FarmersDelight api is now a normal dependency (com.huidu.farmersdelight:farmersdelight-plugin),
# resolved from the sibling ../FarmersDelight checkout or, without it, from a Gradle source dependency
# on the git repository -- see settings.gradle.kts. Nothing has to be vendored under libs/ any more;
